      "title": "Rename and Renaming are the same frame drawn twice",
      "detail": "The file holds two frames, 'Rename' and 'Renaming', with 223 nodes each. The only difference between them is the position of a separator inside the keyboard instance. Nothing shows the typing state as distinct from the opened state, so only one is published here.",
